# Committed, intentionally empty: the `wrangler types --env-file` source (see .env.types)
!.env.types

# Wrangler's local secrets file. Never commit it; the committed template documents the
# keys. The negation has to live in this file too: git resolves ignores from the
# shallowest .gitignore down, so the root one alone would be overridden here.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example

